  "description": "Lightweight bivariate (x, y) linear regression for .NET: slope, intercept, correlation, R², slope p-value, confidence intervals, margin of error, and experimental Benjamini-Hochberg q-values. Lineage from 1978 TI-58/59 calculator algorithms.",
  "id": "LinearRegression.Pvalues",
